{
  "id": "groundtruth-notification-flow",
  "name": "GroundTruth - Gmail 通知（FR-6b／FR-8）",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "收件人清單與信件標題／內文由 Django 決定並在請求中送來（見\nbackend/services/notification_service.py，分工原則：業務邏輯在 Django，n8n 只做串接）。\n這支 workflow 只負責把 Django 給的內容轉成一封 Gmail 寄給所有收件人（To 以逗號合併），\n不做任何權限或收件人判斷；webhook 只能回應一次，故刻意不把收件人展開成多個 item。\n\n呼叫端：\n- FR-6b `notify_manual_review_created()`：ManualReviewQueue 建立後\n- FR-8 `notify_approval_step_activated()`：簽核關卡建立／解鎖時\n\n匯入本 workflow 後，需要手動在「寄送 Gmail」節點上完成一次 Google 帳號 OAuth 授權\n（Sign in with Google），這一步無法用程式自動完成，只能由 n8n 使用者在畫面上手動點擊。\n\n2026-09-03 補上「IF：Internal API Key 正確？」節點：webhook 收到請求後先比對\nheader `X-Internal-Api-Key`是否等於 `$env.INTERNAL_API_KEY`，不符合直接回 401，\n不繼續往下寄信。修復前任何人都能直接打這支 webhook 寄信，不需要任何驗證\n（見 docs/ADR/debug/phase7-integration.md 2026-09-03 條目）。",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "note-scope",
      "name": "說明：本流程範圍",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -680,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "notify",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-notify",
      "name": "Webhook 接收通知請求",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -680,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "notify"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Django 送來 { subject, body, recipients: [email, ...], link }。\n// 刻意保持單一 item（收件人以逗號合併成一個 To 欄位、Gmail 一次寄給所有人），\n// 而不是每個收件人各自觸發一次 Gmail 執行——webhook 只能回應一次，若在這裡\n// 展開成多個 item，後面的「寄送 Gmail」「回覆」節點會被觸發多次，webhook\n// 只有第一次成功、其餘會噴 already responded 的錯誤。\nconst payload = $input.first().json.body || {};\nconst recipients = Array.isArray(payload.recipients) ? payload.recipients : [];\nconst subject = String(payload.subject || '(無主旨)');\nconst link = String(payload.link || '');\nconst bodyText = String(payload.body || '') + (link ? `\\n\\n連結：${link}` : '');\n\nif (!recipients.length) {\n  return [{ json: { skipped: true, reason: 'no_recipients' } }];\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { to: recipients.join(','), subject, body: bodyText } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "code-expand-recipients",
      "name": "整理收件人與內容",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-has-recipient",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.skipped}}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-has-recipient",
      "name": "IF：有收件人？",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{$json.to}}",
        "subject": "={{$json.subject}}",
        "message": "={{$json.body}}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gmail-send",
      "name": "寄送 Gmail",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        40,
        -120
      ],
      "webhookId": "gmail-send-placeholder",
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { sent: true } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "id": "respond-sent",
      "name": "回覆：已寄出",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        280,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { sent: false, reason: 'no_recipients' } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "id": "respond-skipped",
      "name": "回覆：無收件人",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        40,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-if-internal-key-notify",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.headers['x-internal-api-key']}}",
              "rightValue": "={{$env.INTERNAL_API_KEY}}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-internal-key-notify",
      "name": "IF：Internal API Key 正確？",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { detail: 'unauthorized' } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 401
        }
      },
      "id": "respond-unauthorized-notify",
      "name": "回覆：未授權",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        60
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook 接收通知請求": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "IF：Internal API Key 正確？",
